# v01.0: Rate limit the task API

Plan: [feature-rate-limit](../plans/feature-rate-limit.md)

The task endpoints answer every request they receive, so one client can spend
the whole budget the rest of them share.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a client over the request budget is rejected
- [ ] Outcome: the budget resets on a rolling window

## Findings

- The window is per client rather than global, so the counter is keyed by the
  caller rather than by the route.

> Test strategy: unit, drive the limiter past the budget and past the window.
